OL,3,ADrought declared in Yorkshire after dry
OL,4,Aweather
OL,5,
OL,6,FDrought has been declared across
OL,7,FYorkshire following months of unusually
OL,8,Fdry weather.
OL,10,FThe Environment Agency said low water
OL,11,Flevels in reservoirs and rivers had
OL,12,Ftriggered the move despite recent
OL,13,Frainfall across parts of the region.
OL,15,FYorkshire officially entered drought
OL,16,Fstatus on Friday after a lack of spring
OL,17,Fand summer rainfall, having previously
OL,18,Fbeen classified as in a period of
OL,19,Fprolonged dry weather.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,309,300,200,140,0,100
